Adds `initialConnections`, a new field for the manifest that can be used
to pre-approve certain origins for communication with your snap, as
such:
```
  "initialConnections": {
    "https://snaps.metamask.io": {},
    "npm:filsnap": {}
  },
  "initialPermissions": {
    "endowment:rpc": {
      "dapps": true,
      "snaps": true
    }
  },
```

This will automatically grant the subjects the required permissions to
invoke the snap after an installation or update has completed. The user
can still revoke these permissions in the UI anytime in the future.

